---
name: bare-python
enabled: true
event: bash
action: block
pattern: (^|[;&|(]\s*)python(\s|$)
---

BLOCKED: bare `python` does not exist on this machine's PATH — recurring exit 127.

Use, depending on the case:
- Standalone script: `python3 script.py`
- API code: `cd apps/api && UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=.venv-host uv run python ...`
- Direct interpreter: `{{ project_root }}/apps/api/.venv-host/bin/python` (absolute path — the cwd resets between Bash commands)
- NEVER `apps/api/.venv` (owned by root, created by the worker container).
